**Module:** IntegrationGateway | **Category:** IntegrationFailure | **Severity:** SEV1-Critical
**Resolution Type:** ConfigChange
**Date:** 2025-11-20
**Guidewire Version:** Jasper

### Summary / Symptom
Outbound policy data feed to the reinsurance partner is failing. The file transfer completes but the partner's system rejects the files due to a changed field delimiter. Reinsurance team can manually export and send data as a workaround. Around 3 daily feeds have failed since Monday.

### Resolution
The outbound policy data feed to the reinsurance partner was failing because the partner changed their file format specification from comma to pipe delimiters without prior notice. As a result, the partner's system rejected the files, although the transfer itself completed successfully. The issue was resolved by updating the outbound feed configuration to use the pipe delimiter, after which the partner confirmed successful receipt of the next scheduled feed. Manual export and sending was used as a temporary workaround until the configuration was corrected.


